2026-07-30 20:55:49,280 - rag_service.services.generation_service - INFO - {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "What is the complete list of exclusion criteria related to prior or concomitant medications?", "system_prompt_version": "a0b9615a", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 37, "section": "4.3.2 Prohibited Therapy", "score": null, "scores": [0.98340684, 0.29401222]}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 36, "section": "4.1.2 Exclusion Criteria", "score": 0.81479084, "scores": null}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 11, "section": "Exclusion Criteria", "score": 0.74816835, "scores": null}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 35, "section": "4.1.2 Exclusion Criteria", "score": 0.42757598, "scores": null}, {"title": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 12, "section": "Exclusion Criteria", "score": 0.3788037, "scores": null}], "context_char_count": 5199, "response": "The following exclusion criteria are related to prior or concomitant medications:\n\n1. **Investigational or approved therapy for investigational use**: Receiving any investigational therapy or any approved therapy for investigational use within 30 days or 5 half-lives prior to Randomisation (whichever is longer). (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 35)\n\n2. **Currently disallowed medications**: Currently taking any medications other than those allowed per protocol guidelines. (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 35)\n\n3. **Antibiotics, antivirals, or antifungals**: Infections (including diverticulitis) requiring treatment with antibiotics, antivirals, or antifungals within 14 days prior to Randomisation. (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 36)\n\n4. **Any prior use of biologic drugs**: Any prior use of biologic drugs. (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 36)\n\n5. **Live (attenuated) vaccines**: Received any live (attenuated) vaccines within 30 days prior to Randomisation. (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 36)\n\n6. **High-dose corticosteroids**: Recent treatment with medium-to-high-dose intravenous corticosteroids (methylprednisolone 60 mg/day or hydrocortisone 300 mg/day) within 8 weeks prior to Randomisation, or oral corticosteroids of more than 20 mg prednisone (or equivalent) within 30 days prior to Randomisation. (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 36)\n\n7. **Immunosuppressants (cyclosporine, tacrolimus, sirolimus, mycophenolate mofetil)**: Receipt of cyclosporine, tacrolimus, sirolimus, or mycophenolate mofetil within 30 days prior to Randomisation. (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 36)\n\n8. **Therapeutic enema or suppository**: Treatment with therapeutic enema or suppository, other than required for endoscopy preparation, within 14 days prior to the screening endoscopy and during the remainder of the trial. (Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 36)\n\nThese criteria are further reinforced in the **Prohibited Therapy** section (Section 4.3.2), which disallows during the trial:\n- Immunomodulating/suppressing drugs, including JAK inhibitors (NB: AZA and 6-MP are allowed per inclusion criteria)\n- Antibiotics when given as treatment for UC relapse\n- Any biologic drugs\n- Any live (attenuated) vaccines\n(Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf, p. 37)", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 35, "section": "4.1.2 Exclusion Criteria", "exactText": "20. Receiving any investigational therapy or any approved therapy for investigational use within 30 days or 5 half-lives prior to Randomization (whichever is longer).\n21. Currently taking any medications other than those allowed per protocol guidelines.", "bboxes": [[72.11999999999992, 308.30398291015604, 555.84, 252.41497521784834]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 36, "section": "4.1.2 Exclusion Criteria", "exactText": "22. Infections (including diverticulitis) requiring treatment with antibiotics, antivirals, or antifungals within 14 days prior to Randomisation.\n23. Any prior use of biologic drugs.\n24. Received any live (attenuated) vaccines within 30 days prior to Randomisation.\n25. Recent treatment with medium-to-high-dose intravenous corticosteroids (methylprednisolone 60 mg/day or hydrocortisone 300 mg/day) within 8 weeks prior to Randomisation or oral corticosteroids of more than 20 mg prednisone(or equivalent) within 30 days prior to Randomisation.\n26. Receipt of cyclosporine, tacrolimus, sirolimus, or mycophenolate mofetil within 30 days prior to Randomisation.\n27. Treatment with therapeutic enema or suppository, other than required for endoscopy preparation, within 14 days prior to the screening endoscopy and during the remainder of the trial.", "bboxes": [[72.12, 738.5039829101562, 555.8400000000001, 713.0949752178485]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 37, "section": "4.3.2 Prohibited Therapy", "exactText": "The following previous or concomitant medications are disallowed during the trial:\n- Immunomodulating/suppressing drugs, including JAK inhibitors (NB: AZA and 6-MP are allowed as per inclusion criteria, see Section 4.1.1).\n- Antibiotics, when given as treatment for UC relapse.\n- Any biologic drugs.\n- Any live (attenuated) vaccines.", "bboxes": [[72.0, 521.6639829101563, 550.44, 481.1349752178486], [72.0, 596.0639829101563, 554.52, 555.4149752178486]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 12, "section": "Exclusion Criteria", "exactText": "24. Received any live (attenuated) vaccines within 30 days prior to Randomisation.\n25. Recent treatment with medium-to-high-dose intravenous corticosteroids (methylprednisolone 60 mg/day or hydrocortisone 300 mg/day) within 8 weeks prior to Randomisation or oral corticosteroids of more than 20 mg prednisone (or equivalent) within 30 days prior to Randomisation.\n26. Receipt of cyclosporine, tacrolimus, sirolimus, or mycophenolate mofetil within 30 days prior to Randomisation.\n27. Treatment with therapeutic enema or suppository, other than required for endoscopy preparation, within 14 days prior to the screening endoscopy and during the remainder of the trial.", "bboxes": [[72.12, 732.3839829101563, 478.2, 722.0949752178486]], "relevance": "medium"}, {"name": "Protocol_Ulcerative Colitis.pdf", "page": 11, "section": "Exclusion Criteria", "exactText": "20. Receiving any investigational therapy or any approved therapy for investigational use within 30 days or 5 half-lives prior to Randomization (whichever is longer).\n21. Currently taking any medications other than those allowed per protocol guidelines.\n22. Infections (including diverticulitis) requiring treatment with antibiotics, antivirals, or antifungals within 14 days prior to Randomisation.\n23. Any prior use of biologic drugs.", "bboxes": [[72.12, 368.7839829101563, 555.84, 313.0149752178486]], "relevance": "medium"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": true, "embedding_ms": 202.5569169782102, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_search_ms": 228.24550000950694, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filter_applied": true, "confidence_filter_threshold": 0.04, "confidence_filter_bm25_threshold": null, "confidence_filter_input_count": 45, "confidence_filter_kept_count": 45, "confidence_filter_dropped_count": 0, "confidence_filter_kept_scores": [0.5687, 0.5655, 0.5642, 0.5556, 0.5411, 0.5347, 0.5173, 0.5097, 0.5015, 0.4985, 0.4966, 0.4952, 0.4757, 0.4751, 0.4691, 0.4501, 0.4465, 0.445, 0.4415, 0.4337, 0.4215, 0.4114, 0.4037, 0.4032, 0.4023, 0.3961, 0.3897, 0.3889, 0.3875, 0.386, 0.3847, 0.3787, 0.3762, 0.3756, 0.3755, 0.3722, 0.3715, 0.3709, 0.3698, 0.3693, 0.3687, 0.3687, 0.3677, 0.3673, 0.367], "confidence_filter_dropped_scores": [], "confidence_filter_bm25_only_scores_normalized": [], "hybrid_search": true, "cache_hit": true, "embedding_ms": 0.0, "db_search_ms": 701.2080409913324, "hybrid_parallel_ms"